WEBVTT

00:01.610 --> 00:02.947
(The tassel crowns the knight.
The sword is snow white.)

00:02.971 --> 00:04.306
(In the silver saddle,
he rides like a shooting star.)

00:04.330 --> 00:07.546
(He kills a man within ten steps.
Invincible he is all the way ahead.)

00:07.570 --> 00:13.130
(He would leave once it's done.
No trace of him is to be found.)

01:26.130 --> 01:31.090
=Sword Snow Stride= (Season 1)

01:31.250 --> 01:34.490
=Episode 27=

01:37.715 --> 01:38.447
Don't!

01:38.471 --> 01:40.015
Xu Fengnian doesn't deserve to die.

01:40.765 --> 01:42.265
You shouldn't be here.

01:42.640 --> 01:43.910
You know me, don't you?

01:56.740 --> 01:59.715
Your mother was the head
of the 3,000 swordsmen of Chu.

02:00.115 --> 02:01.270
Of course, I've seen you.

02:01.990 --> 02:03.606
Lord of Jing'an used me as a pawn

02:03.630 --> 02:04.741
and sent me to assassinate Xu Fengnian,

02:04.765 --> 02:06.510
but Xu didn't kill me.

02:06.890 --> 02:08.341
He's been really good to Her Grace.

02:08.365 --> 02:09.710
He didn't deceive her.

02:11.165 --> 02:13.090
If they hadn't spoken for you,

02:13.690 --> 02:14.710
you would have been dead.

02:17.165 --> 02:18.430
Your Grace, you're still alive.

02:19.265 --> 02:21.190
It's a blessing for our country.

02:21.710 --> 02:23.950
My father asked Xu Xiao not to kill me.

02:24.640 --> 02:25.840
Because of that,

02:26.240 --> 02:27.870
I'll spare Xu Xiao's life for one time.

02:28.140 --> 02:29.491
If you're that good,

02:29.515 --> 02:31.595
why haven't you ever
been to North Liang these years?

02:32.090 --> 02:33.690
Avoid the solid and strike the weak.

02:34.240 --> 02:36.566
North Liang is dangerous.
I won't go there recklessly.

02:36.590 --> 02:38.040
But you broke into the palace.

02:38.415 --> 02:39.890
North Liang is more dangerous

02:40.615 --> 02:42.115
than the palace of Liyang.

02:42.765 --> 02:43.965
Are you afraid of North Liang?

02:45.415 --> 02:47.215
If I had known
Her Grace was in North Liang,

02:47.490 --> 02:48.690
I would have been there early.

02:48.865 --> 02:49.640
Your Grace.

02:49.740 --> 02:50.740
These years,

02:50.890 --> 02:51.910
you've suffered a lot.

02:52.090 --> 02:53.750
I'm fine, actually.

02:54.065 --> 02:56.510
Your Grace,
do you have anything to pack?

02:56.665 --> 02:57.466
To pack?

02:57.490 --> 02:58.490
Why should I pack?

02:58.740 --> 03:00.890
I'm taking you back to Chu.

03:02.790 --> 03:04.365
West Chu has long perished.

03:04.490 --> 03:05.790
But we still have the people.

03:06.415 --> 03:08.790
It isn't just you, is it?

03:12.090 --> 03:13.090
Of course not.

03:13.590 --> 03:14.590
Not just me.

03:15.265 --> 03:16.590
The survivors of Chu

03:16.915 --> 03:18.190
have gathered in Shu.

03:18.515 --> 03:20.230
Shu is in chaos now.

03:20.790 --> 03:22.430
All of the people are your subjects.

03:22.815 --> 03:23.950
They've been in despair.

03:24.315 --> 03:26.790
They look forward to returning home
with Your Grace.

03:27.665 --> 03:28.665
No way!

03:28.715 --> 03:29.715
I won't let her go.

03:29.815 --> 03:30.840
I didn't ask you.

03:30.965 --> 03:32.110
She is mine!

03:32.870 --> 03:34.015
Nonsense.

03:36.965 --> 03:37.965
Move.

03:38.190 --> 03:39.870
He wanted Jiang Ni and I stopped him.

03:40.540 --> 03:41.910
I'll stop you, too.

03:43.265 --> 03:44.870
No one can stop me

03:45.115 --> 03:46.590
if I decide to take her away.

03:51.040 --> 03:52.340
Snakes in Sleeves.

03:52.940 --> 03:54.065
Li Chungang?

04:02.990 --> 04:04.990
I know my name.

04:05.340 --> 04:06.340
You needn't tell me.

04:06.565 --> 04:08.290
Weren't you left at Mansion of Lu?

04:08.565 --> 04:10.916
Did you think I was so gullible?

04:10.940 --> 04:12.066
Have you been with me all the time?

04:12.090 --> 04:13.486
It was patchy at best

04:13.510 --> 04:15.115
when you fought Lu Baijie.

04:15.290 --> 04:16.910
After that,
it was unbearable to witness.

04:17.215 --> 04:18.215
Step aside.

04:18.265 --> 04:19.265
I'll talk with you later.

04:20.965 --> 04:23.166
Even Wang Xianzhi

04:23.190 --> 04:24.390
can't stop me today.

04:45.390 --> 04:46.290
You're getting old.

04:46.340 --> 04:47.710
Cut the nonsense!

05:08.740 --> 05:09.470
Chess...

05:09.710 --> 05:11.290
Uncle Chess Master.

05:12.790 --> 05:13.790
Your Grace.

05:13.990 --> 05:15.590
Would you please stop fighting?

05:28.490 --> 05:29.590
I am

05:30.070 --> 05:31.350
at your disposal.

05:32.270 --> 05:33.440
Uncle Chess Master.

05:34.990 --> 05:36.515
Can I stay here?

05:38.790 --> 05:39.990
Your Grace.

05:40.915 --> 05:42.040
If you stay,

05:42.740 --> 05:44.015
you're a maid at best.

05:44.715 --> 05:47.550
Do you think he'll marry a maid?

05:48.390 --> 05:49.710
I don't want to marry him.

05:50.140 --> 05:51.140
Wait a minute.

05:52.670 --> 05:53.840
Since there is no fight,

05:54.265 --> 05:56.116
why don't we go inside

05:56.140 --> 05:57.270
and have a good talk?

05:58.890 --> 05:59.890
All right.

06:03.340 --> 06:04.340
Qingniao,

06:05.490 --> 06:06.606
go to tell

06:06.630 --> 06:08.206
Grandpa Wei and Ning Emei

06:08.230 --> 06:09.526
to guard the temple.

06:09.550 --> 06:10.550
Don't let anybody in.

06:19.340 --> 06:20.540
After I die,

06:22.265 --> 06:24.785
Your Highness, please let
the little girl outside the temple go.

06:25.840 --> 06:27.065
Why would you die?

06:27.465 --> 06:28.765
Cao Changqing showed up.

06:28.990 --> 06:30.315
Shu will be in chaos.

06:30.615 --> 06:32.190
I've heard all the big news.

06:32.740 --> 06:34.420
Heaven will not tolerate it
if I don't die.

06:35.390 --> 06:36.790
In fact, you have another choice.

06:37.065 --> 06:38.865
If you go to North Liang,

06:39.315 --> 06:40.615
you won't have to die.

06:41.540 --> 06:43.140
If I go, the little girl

06:43.465 --> 06:44.641
will have no one to depend on.

06:44.665 --> 06:46.141
Take her to North Liang.

06:46.165 --> 06:48.525
Her paralyzed grandpa is seriously ill.
He can't travel far.

06:48.765 --> 06:50.310
Before he passes away,

06:50.340 --> 06:51.510
I can't leave Yangzhou.

06:52.015 --> 06:53.015
Don't worry.

06:53.265 --> 06:54.390
Stay and take care of her.

06:55.865 --> 06:56.865
Stay?

07:01.215 --> 07:01.917
Take it.

07:01.941 --> 07:03.950
Use the money to treat her grandpa.

07:04.165 --> 07:05.291
When he gets better,

07:05.315 --> 07:07.075
hire a carriage
and take them to North Liang.

07:10.740 --> 07:11.965
Do you mean

07:12.940 --> 07:13.965
I can leave?

07:14.415 --> 07:15.455
There is no fight anymore.

07:15.565 --> 07:16.830
You can't see the fun anyway.

07:16.965 --> 07:18.515
Aren't you afraid I may leak the news?

07:21.615 --> 07:22.815
If I want you to work for me,

07:23.690 --> 07:24.790
I must trust you.

07:27.190 --> 07:28.265
Chen Xiliang

07:28.690 --> 07:29.710
is at your disposal.

07:29.790 --> 07:31.350
My Lord, please wait for me.

07:32.090 --> 07:33.210
No matter how long it takes,

07:33.790 --> 07:35.065
I'll wait for you.

07:49.665 --> 07:51.440
Do you think he can work for you?

07:51.840 --> 07:52.840
Yes.

07:54.465 --> 07:55.990
Aren't you afraid he'll betray you?

07:56.915 --> 07:58.246
The circumstances of gentry
and those of humble families

07:58.270 --> 07:59.950
are worlds apart in Yangzhou.

08:00.840 --> 08:02.190
His only hope

08:02.815 --> 08:04.265
is to go to North Liang.

08:05.790 --> 08:07.830
If I made a bad decision,

08:08.290 --> 08:09.590
would you still follow me?

08:10.340 --> 08:11.566
(Baoguo Temple)
As long as my grandpa is fine,

08:11.590 --> 08:13.470
(Baoguo Temple)
I'll follow you wherever you go.

08:14.165 --> 08:15.490
That's a deal, then.

08:15.940 --> 08:17.240
When your grandpa gets better,

08:17.910 --> 08:18.910
let's leave Jiangnan.

08:19.510 --> 08:20.540
Where to go?

08:20.740 --> 08:21.740
North.

08:25.965 --> 08:28.915
(Memorial to the throne: tax of tea
and other items, 562 taels of silver)

08:45.240 --> 08:46.310
Prime Minister.

08:49.640 --> 08:50.710
There you are.

08:52.865 --> 08:54.265
You asked to see me.

08:54.415 --> 08:55.640
How dare I not come?

09:01.340 --> 09:03.390
You're really enjoying this.

09:05.265 --> 09:06.265
Yeah.

09:08.365 --> 09:11.550
I don't like to build a reputation
of honesty and poverty.

09:13.065 --> 09:15.006
I want all the scholars

09:15.030 --> 09:16.070
to envy me.

09:16.440 --> 09:17.440
Thus, it may arise

09:17.915 --> 09:20.230
their ambitions to get promotions.

09:26.540 --> 09:27.665
Don't you agree?

09:28.640 --> 09:29.640
I'm not in a position

09:29.915 --> 09:30.915
to make comments.

09:31.940 --> 09:35.270
I heard Cao Changqing
showed up at Yangzhou.

09:36.340 --> 09:37.390
I heard that, too.

09:37.765 --> 09:39.116
The last time when people saw him,

09:39.140 --> 09:40.990
he seemed to head towards Yangcheng.

09:41.350 --> 09:43.150
Is Xu Fengnian at Yangcheng, too?

09:46.350 --> 09:48.240
We can take advantage of it.

09:49.065 --> 09:50.406
We can spread the news

09:50.430 --> 09:52.165
of North Liang and Cao Changqing...

09:53.990 --> 09:54.990
No.

09:55.965 --> 09:56.965
No.

09:57.415 --> 09:58.550
Wait a bit longer.

10:00.915 --> 10:02.640
Don't be anxious.

10:03.090 --> 10:04.090
Let's see

10:04.690 --> 10:06.690
if Cao Changqing

10:06.840 --> 10:08.160
will meet Xu Fengnian

10:08.415 --> 10:09.535
and

10:10.140 --> 10:11.220
what happens

10:12.465 --> 10:13.905
when they meet.

10:18.615 --> 10:19.615
Yes.

10:21.040 --> 10:22.430
Keep me posted

10:22.990 --> 10:24.870
if there is any news.

10:30.065 --> 10:31.265
Rest assured, Prime Minister.

10:31.990 --> 10:32.990
You can go.

10:41.415 --> 10:43.250
You're really diligent

10:43.540 --> 10:46.115
in handling official business at home.

10:51.040 --> 10:52.740
Bringing the memorials back home

10:53.390 --> 10:54.910
isn't appropriate, actually.

10:55.140 --> 10:56.615
But to manage state affairs,

10:56.915 --> 11:00.090
I can't attend to the trifles.

11:04.550 --> 11:07.070
People who make great achievements
don't stick to small details.

11:07.190 --> 11:08.550
Prime Minister,

11:09.030 --> 11:10.390
you're with high ambitions.

11:34.090 --> 11:35.440
Righteous men of Chu

11:35.690 --> 11:36.870
who are hidden in Shu

11:37.015 --> 11:38.630
have been expecting you for long.

11:38.990 --> 11:40.206
Xu Fengnian is very likely

11:40.230 --> 11:41.391
to be the next lord of North Liang.

11:41.415 --> 11:42.470
The royal court of Liyang

11:42.890 --> 11:44.665
may give him a princess.

11:44.940 --> 11:46.141
Although North Liang is strong,

11:46.165 --> 11:48.670
it is subordinated to Liyang.

11:49.190 --> 11:50.127
What does it have to do with Xu Family

11:50.151 --> 11:51.391
whether Jiang Ni leaves or not?

11:52.015 --> 11:53.015
Your Grace,

11:53.240 --> 11:54.365
our people want you

11:54.715 --> 11:56.140
to go with me to Shu.

11:56.540 --> 11:57.790
After we gather our troops,

11:58.140 --> 11:59.620
we can return to West Chu.

11:59.990 --> 12:00.990
Liyang

12:01.040 --> 12:02.066
will have another enemy, then.

12:02.090 --> 12:03.090
North Liang's position

12:03.215 --> 12:04.290
is more secure that way.

12:04.965 --> 12:05.965
Besides,

12:06.240 --> 12:07.670
when you become the queen of Chu,

12:07.940 --> 12:10.741
you'll be a fine match for Xu Fengnian.

12:10.765 --> 12:12.490
I have nothing to do with him.

12:12.715 --> 12:13.510
Mr. Cao,

12:13.640 --> 12:14.765
can I say something?

12:15.565 --> 12:16.140
Yeah.

12:16.465 --> 12:17.465
First,

12:17.565 --> 12:18.646
We won't let bandits have their own way

12:18.670 --> 12:19.691
in order to distinguish ourselves.

12:19.715 --> 12:20.715
Second,

12:20.815 --> 12:22.086
we keep the army ready for combat

12:22.110 --> 12:23.590
in order to bring peace to the world.

12:23.665 --> 12:25.266
We've never thought of rebellion

12:25.290 --> 12:26.350
and starting a war again.

12:26.465 --> 12:27.990
You're so pedantic and simple.

12:28.115 --> 12:29.391
How can you be the Lord of North Liang?

12:29.415 --> 12:30.926
There are enough big shots
who have little regard

12:30.950 --> 12:31.950
for human life.

12:32.290 --> 12:33.247
I prefer to be a pedantic lord

12:33.271 --> 12:35.090
with a bottom line.

12:37.490 --> 12:38.790
What's your choice, Your Grace?

12:40.590 --> 12:42.991
I've never wanted to be a big shot.

12:43.015 --> 12:44.265
Not a big shot.

12:45.315 --> 12:47.240
You're the last hope of our people.

12:47.390 --> 12:49.990
Can you bear to see them
being hopeless again?

12:50.315 --> 12:51.716
Why must it be me?

12:51.740 --> 12:53.070
Your blood

12:53.265 --> 12:54.486
brings you glory

12:54.510 --> 12:55.630
as well as responsibilities.

12:55.965 --> 12:56.717
Your Grace,

12:56.741 --> 12:58.286
the royal family has no right
to shirk their responsibilities.

12:58.310 --> 12:59.310
Enough!

13:01.565 --> 13:02.565
Don't push her.

13:02.865 --> 13:04.615
If you let Her Grace go with me,

13:05.140 --> 13:06.710
I'll kill Chen Zhibao for you.

13:06.915 --> 13:08.235
Jiang Ni isn't a bargaining chip.

13:08.365 --> 13:09.445
No matter what you give me,

13:09.640 --> 13:10.640
I won't trade her for it.

13:11.590 --> 13:12.590
You

13:13.465 --> 13:15.030
want to force her to stay?

13:17.590 --> 13:19.015
It's her fate.

13:19.765 --> 13:21.070
Let her make the choice.

13:28.640 --> 13:30.215
Have you thought about going home?

13:31.815 --> 13:32.950
It's my dream to go home.

13:34.865 --> 13:36.150
Since Chu perished,

13:37.265 --> 13:38.550
we've become

13:39.240 --> 13:41.120
rootless duckweeds

13:42.040 --> 13:43.670
that have nothing to depend on.

13:44.940 --> 13:46.500
We can't find a place to return.

13:47.315 --> 13:48.710
We don't know where to go.

13:51.415 --> 13:53.230
If we reunite with the people of Chu,

13:54.040 --> 13:56.240
we're not far from going home.

13:57.590 --> 13:58.590
But, Your Grace,

13:58.915 --> 13:59.950
it's not important.

14:01.415 --> 14:02.415
What?

14:03.990 --> 14:05.590
You have your own life.

14:06.290 --> 14:07.330
You don't owe us anything.

14:08.190 --> 14:10.665
You're not just the princess,

14:14.615 --> 14:16.055
you're also my friend.

14:21.615 --> 14:22.615
Your Grace,

14:23.640 --> 14:25.215
I respect your choice.

14:34.415 --> 14:35.326
I'm going with you.

14:35.350 --> 14:36.350
Jiang Ni!

14:38.590 --> 14:40.670
In fact, I'm used to being a maid,

14:43.040 --> 14:44.590
reading books to make money.

14:46.390 --> 14:47.630
Spending several copper coins

14:48.015 --> 14:50.655
on some rouge and powder
would make me happy for a long time.

14:51.440 --> 14:52.886
Occasionally, I stole
some cakes and pastries,

14:52.910 --> 14:54.265
and you didn't find out.

14:56.110 --> 14:57.910
Life is simple,

14:58.740 --> 15:00.070
but I like it.

15:00.590 --> 15:01.710
Then stay.

15:06.090 --> 15:07.940
But Uncle Chess Master is right.

15:08.790 --> 15:10.190
I have responsibilities.

15:11.540 --> 15:13.790
Too many people are expecting me.

15:15.550 --> 15:18.350
They're looking forward
to the silver lining in darkness.

15:19.290 --> 15:20.750
I've tasted despair.

15:21.740 --> 15:23.446
I know how important

15:23.470 --> 15:25.190
the silver lining is to them.

15:28.890 --> 15:30.110
I'm Jiang Ni.

15:30.390 --> 15:31.830
I'm your maid,

15:33.040 --> 15:34.910
but I'm also the princess of West Chu,

15:35.290 --> 15:36.790
a royal descendant.

15:50.615 --> 15:52.315
Cao Changqing.

15:53.090 --> 15:54.990
Yu Youwei.

15:55.115 --> 15:57.190
Greetings, Your Grace!

16:06.465 --> 16:07.990
I'll give you my first order.

16:08.440 --> 16:09.486
From now on,

16:09.510 --> 16:11.470
you needn't kneel to me.

16:12.865 --> 16:13.865
Your Grace.

16:14.165 --> 16:15.440
We mustn't neglect etiquette.

16:16.110 --> 16:17.110
Uncle Chess Master,

16:17.830 --> 16:19.016
are you going to disobey my orders?

16:19.040 --> 16:20.070
I dare not.

16:23.640 --> 16:24.640
Your Grace,

16:25.265 --> 16:26.366
let's set off now.

16:26.390 --> 16:27.390
I'll leave with you,

16:27.615 --> 16:28.615
but not now.

16:28.815 --> 16:30.310
What do you mean?

16:32.440 --> 16:34.830
Is the next stop after Jiangnan
Mount Longhu?

16:35.515 --> 16:36.150
Yes.

16:36.265 --> 16:38.790
Except for Wudi City,

16:38.865 --> 16:40.945
the most dangerous place on the trip
is Mount Longhu.

16:41.865 --> 16:43.550
I want to go with him first.

16:44.090 --> 16:45.591
After we leave Mount Longhu,

16:45.615 --> 16:47.715
I'll go westward with you.

16:49.065 --> 16:51.065
I'm not doing it for Xu Fengnian.

16:51.990 --> 16:53.830
Xu Family saved my life.

16:54.265 --> 16:55.870
I owed them.

16:56.240 --> 16:57.265
But, Your Grace,

16:57.815 --> 16:58.815
we have two problems.

16:59.430 --> 17:00.691
Please speak out.

17:00.715 --> 17:01.715
First,

17:01.790 --> 17:03.080
since I've shown up,

17:03.315 --> 17:05.666
you shouldn't travel

17:05.690 --> 17:06.870
with Xu Fengnian openly,

17:07.315 --> 17:10.190
otherwise, people will think
North Liang has allied with West Chu.

17:10.540 --> 17:12.990
The emperor of Liyang
won't spare the Xu Family.

17:13.615 --> 17:15.470
Then I'll pretend to leave with you

17:15.715 --> 17:17.390
while going along with him in secret.

17:17.765 --> 17:18.765
Sounds good.

17:20.040 --> 17:21.040
Second,

17:21.140 --> 17:22.550
what should Xu Fengnian do?

17:22.865 --> 17:25.350
Harboring the princess of West Chu
for so many years,

17:26.140 --> 17:27.950
how does he explain to the royal court?

17:28.265 --> 17:29.310
Don't worry about that.

17:29.690 --> 17:30.830
Over the years,

17:30.915 --> 17:33.110
I've been trying
to assassinate Xu Fengnian.

17:33.390 --> 17:34.670
They can easily figure it out.

17:34.890 --> 17:37.366
Inferring from that,
they'll make the conclusion

17:37.390 --> 17:38.910
that I've been hiding my identity

17:39.165 --> 17:40.550
and trying to take revenge.

17:40.865 --> 17:41.890
Your Grace,

17:42.365 --> 17:44.165
you've been trying
to assassinate Xu Fengnian.

17:45.165 --> 17:46.165
Why?

17:47.790 --> 17:48.727
Because...

17:48.751 --> 17:50.670
The life of the princess of Chu
is useful.

17:50.715 --> 17:52.206
Of all people, why did they spare me?

17:52.230 --> 17:53.326
At the crucial moment,

17:53.350 --> 17:55.030
they can trade my life for something.

17:55.365 --> 17:57.990
I thought Xu Xiao would kill me,

17:58.790 --> 18:01.416
so I've been trying to assassinate
Xu Fengnian since I was a child.

18:01.440 --> 18:03.190
Granted that
Xu Xiao harbored evil intent,

18:03.490 --> 18:05.215
what did it have to do with you
killing me?

18:07.415 --> 18:08.766
Are all men fools?

18:08.790 --> 18:09.890
It's obvious.

18:10.590 --> 18:12.246
Jiang Ni knew she would die,

18:12.270 --> 18:13.606
so she kept trying to assassinate you

18:13.630 --> 18:15.126
in order to make you hate her.

18:15.150 --> 18:17.016
She was afraid
if she died in the future,

18:17.040 --> 18:18.315
you might be sad.

18:21.790 --> 18:23.690
That was why you tried

18:24.265 --> 18:25.745
to assassinate me in the first place?

18:27.265 --> 18:28.965
Let's put that aside.

18:30.990 --> 18:33.270
Another question is on my mind.

18:33.540 --> 18:35.740
If Xu Xiao really wanted to kill me,

18:36.465 --> 18:39.790
would he let me overhear it?

18:47.665 --> 18:48.890
I don't think so.

18:49.015 --> 18:50.140
I don't, either.

18:50.515 --> 18:51.566
I think Xu Xiao

18:51.590 --> 18:53.270
let me overhear it on purpose.

18:53.840 --> 18:54.567
And,

18:54.591 --> 18:56.340
I tried to assassinate him
again and again.

18:56.515 --> 18:58.126
Did it really escape Xu Xiao's notice?

18:58.150 --> 18:59.715
Why didn't he stop me?

19:01.440 --> 19:03.070
Do you remember your words?

19:05.415 --> 19:08.715
Xu Xiao often says he'll pay any price
to achieve his goals.

19:09.315 --> 19:12.465
I'm afraid you two are the price
this time.

19:14.040 --> 19:15.290
At first,

19:16.040 --> 19:18.465
I thought Xu Xiao would give you
to the Lu family.

19:18.715 --> 19:20.150
Now I think about it,

19:20.640 --> 19:22.230
Uncle Chess Master shows up,

19:22.465 --> 19:24.110
if we go with him,

19:24.315 --> 19:25.966
the failed assassinations over the years

19:25.990 --> 19:29.070
happen to clear Xu Family
of suspicion and hidden dangers.

19:29.565 --> 19:30.840
Is it just a coincidence?

19:31.365 --> 19:32.665
Because of you,

19:33.015 --> 19:34.270
he didn't kill me.

19:34.615 --> 19:36.590
Yu Youwei and I play our real role

19:36.740 --> 19:37.990
here

19:38.115 --> 19:39.230
instead of Lu Family.

19:40.115 --> 19:41.006
Mr. Cao.

19:41.030 --> 19:41.567
Yeah?

19:41.591 --> 19:42.791
Why did you come to Yangcheng?

19:43.040 --> 19:44.230
I came for Her Grace.

19:44.415 --> 19:45.741
How did you know Jiang Ni was with me?

19:45.765 --> 19:47.910
I didn't know if she was alive,

19:48.140 --> 19:49.440
but I found this.

19:52.215 --> 19:53.166
- Divine Token?
- Divine Token?

19:53.190 --> 19:54.190
Yes.

19:54.490 --> 19:56.070
It's the treasure of West Chu.

19:56.465 --> 19:58.470
I found it in the hands of a vendor.

19:59.265 --> 20:00.470
Following the clue,

20:01.015 --> 20:02.015
I came all the way here.

20:02.365 --> 20:03.890
Didn't you have the Divine Token?

20:03.990 --> 20:05.126
Someone borrowed it.

20:05.150 --> 20:06.150
Who?

20:07.390 --> 20:10.265
His Lordship wants to borrow something
from you.

20:15.115 --> 20:16.366
Grandpa Wei told you

20:16.390 --> 20:17.816
that Xu Xiao wanted to borrow
the Divine Token?

20:17.840 --> 20:18.840
Yeah.

20:19.465 --> 20:20.870
That's the reason

20:21.265 --> 20:22.670
why Grandpa Wei came with me.

20:22.965 --> 20:24.715
Xu Xiao planned everything.

20:25.115 --> 20:27.215
Today you'll be taken away.

20:27.740 --> 20:29.065
The princess of Chu reappears.

20:29.215 --> 20:30.655
Liyang has another formidable enemy.

20:30.790 --> 20:32.865
North Liang's position
will be more secure.

20:33.265 --> 20:35.541
He didn't kick you out
because your services were still needed.

20:35.565 --> 20:38.090
Xu Xiao deliberately allowed Her Grace
to assassinate you,

20:38.540 --> 20:39.487
so that in the future,

20:39.511 --> 20:40.865
the whole world would know

20:41.040 --> 20:43.590
Xu Fengnian resolved not to coexist
with Her Grace.

20:44.215 --> 20:46.295
In that case, the royal court
would be more relieved.

20:46.490 --> 20:47.886
The next lord of North Liang

20:47.910 --> 20:49.190
would be me for sure.

20:49.790 --> 20:50.790
All of these

20:50.940 --> 20:52.510
were planned by Xu Xiao.

20:53.565 --> 20:56.365
He has been scheming it
since I was a child.

20:57.040 --> 20:58.340
Xu Xiao

20:58.715 --> 21:00.140
is a good player.

21:01.565 --> 21:04.090
Aren't you a matchless chess master?

21:04.290 --> 21:05.326
How come you become

21:05.350 --> 21:07.070
someone else's chess piece?

21:07.840 --> 21:08.965
West Chu perished.

21:09.340 --> 21:10.365
My last game

21:10.665 --> 21:11.740
came to a dead end.

21:12.640 --> 21:13.640
Since then,

21:13.940 --> 21:15.415
I've never been a player again.

21:16.390 --> 21:18.115
Now I find Her Grace.

21:18.565 --> 21:19.615
We can start a new game.

21:20.215 --> 21:22.690
I'll challenge the heroes
all over the world.

21:27.540 --> 21:28.540
Your Grace.

21:33.065 --> 21:34.065
It's time to go.

21:34.640 --> 21:35.640
Let's fake

21:35.840 --> 21:37.390
you being taken away by me.

21:39.815 --> 21:42.790
I'll leave after Mount Longhu.

21:43.240 --> 21:44.350
It seems suspicious

21:45.015 --> 21:46.115
if we leave easily.

21:52.240 --> 21:53.840
Come to the point.

21:53.990 --> 21:55.766
I don't feel like guessing riddles.

21:55.790 --> 21:57.190
Now that I've met God of Sword,

21:57.390 --> 22:00.315
how can I miss the chance
of appreciating Snakes in Sleeves?

22:05.990 --> 22:07.365
(Baoguo Temple)

22:15.390 --> 22:17.391
(Baoguo Temple)

22:17.415 --> 22:18.940
Snakes in Sleeves?

22:20.415 --> 22:21.415
They're fighting.

22:42.365 --> 22:43.390
Am I still alive?

22:43.940 --> 22:44.806
Where is Cao Changqing?

22:44.830 --> 22:45.792
He recognized

22:45.816 --> 22:47.630
Jiang Ni, the princess of Chu,

22:47.890 --> 22:48.950
and became furious.

22:49.065 --> 22:50.066
Then he

22:50.090 --> 22:50.890
attacked Fengnian.

22:51.090 --> 22:53.090
Fortunately, Mr. Li arrived in time.

22:53.290 --> 22:55.141
He exchanged one move
with Cao Changqing.

22:55.165 --> 22:56.230
Who won?

22:56.500 --> 22:57.910
It ended in a dead heat.

22:58.315 --> 23:00.616
Cao took Jiang Ni and Yu Youwei away.

23:00.640 --> 23:02.391
In order to protect Fengnian,

23:02.415 --> 23:03.550
Mr. Li didn't chase them.

23:07.190 --> 23:09.015
Indeed, she is the princess of Chu.

23:09.340 --> 23:11.870
Unfortunately,
I didn't see them fighting.

23:13.115 --> 23:14.115
Where is Fengnian?

23:14.390 --> 23:15.490
He's in the yard.

23:44.865 --> 23:45.940
Mr. Lu, are you awake?

23:47.240 --> 23:49.240
Did they only exchange one move?

23:49.515 --> 23:50.515
Yes.

23:50.740 --> 23:52.015
Only one move.

23:52.690 --> 23:53.990
It's like the immortals

23:54.465 --> 23:55.585
coming to earth.

23:55.840 --> 23:57.090
Who would have thought

23:57.415 --> 23:59.565
that a man could have
such terrible power?

24:01.340 --> 24:02.790
Now that you're awake,

24:03.390 --> 24:04.630
do you still want to attack me?

24:04.890 --> 24:06.390
Lu Family never wanted

24:06.640 --> 24:07.950
to break with North Liang.

24:08.415 --> 24:09.415
What happened today,

24:09.465 --> 24:10.465
in the end,

24:11.815 --> 24:13.490
is the result of her resentment.

24:13.990 --> 24:15.110
Fix all the blame on her?

24:15.240 --> 24:17.066
There must be someone
that serves as a vent to your anger.

24:17.090 --> 24:18.090
I'm not angry.

24:18.815 --> 24:20.230
She has the right to hate me.

24:20.515 --> 24:21.446
It's not a capital offense.

24:21.470 --> 24:22.470
You're merciful.

24:22.915 --> 24:23.915
I admire that.

24:24.440 --> 24:25.765
My sister decides to stay.

24:26.865 --> 24:28.870
If you don't want to break with us,

24:29.565 --> 24:30.565
please be kind to her.

24:30.815 --> 24:31.890
Rest assured.

24:33.415 --> 24:35.090
Let me walk you out.

24:41.165 --> 24:42.390
I'm thinking about something.

24:43.265 --> 24:44.265
What is it?

24:45.265 --> 24:47.670
Grandpa Wei borrowed Divine Token
from Mr. Li,

24:48.015 --> 24:50.150
but there must be another person

24:50.365 --> 24:51.550
who let Cao find it,

24:51.815 --> 24:53.950
provided clues to him

24:54.390 --> 24:55.670
and led him to Baoguo Temple.

24:56.140 --> 24:57.566
Grandpa Wei came to Jiangnan
for the first time.

24:57.590 --> 24:58.940
He doesn't have anyone on hand.

25:00.265 --> 25:01.265
And?

25:01.715 --> 25:04.140
When Cao tried to attack me,

25:04.590 --> 25:06.590
you were very calm.

25:08.690 --> 25:10.830
You knew Jiang Ni and Yu Youwei

25:11.490 --> 25:12.950
wouldn't allow him to kill me.

25:13.915 --> 25:15.590
Even if Jiang Ni couldn't stop him,

25:15.865 --> 25:16.865
you knew

25:17.065 --> 25:18.630
that Mr. Li was here.

25:19.965 --> 25:21.640
All changes today

25:22.415 --> 25:24.015
were within your expectation.

25:28.440 --> 25:29.615
The whole scheme in Jiangnan

25:30.040 --> 25:31.640
was under your control.

25:35.465 --> 25:37.190
I didn't get it all under control.

25:38.265 --> 25:39.830
You being attacked by that woman

25:39.940 --> 25:41.510
was beyond my expectation.

25:41.790 --> 25:43.430
I was scared to death.

25:43.640 --> 25:45.510
You knew Jiang Ni was Xu Xiao's pawn.

25:45.865 --> 25:47.466
He would give her to Cao.

25:47.490 --> 25:48.490
I knew.

25:48.715 --> 25:50.230
But you never told me.

25:52.290 --> 25:53.565
Over the years,

25:55.615 --> 25:57.690
I've been watching Jiang Ni and you.

25:58.965 --> 26:01.390
Your second sister and I
left North Liang one after another.

26:02.340 --> 26:04.070
In a way,

26:05.090 --> 26:07.150
it was Jiang Ni
who had accompanied you till today.

26:09.690 --> 26:10.690
Fengnian,

26:10.965 --> 26:12.110
trust me.

26:12.940 --> 26:14.070
Only in this way

26:14.390 --> 26:15.766
could Jiang Ni and you

26:15.790 --> 26:17.190
have a future.

26:25.415 --> 26:26.415
Zhihu,

26:29.590 --> 26:31.230
you made a real effort
to hide it from me.

26:34.365 --> 26:36.115
Though I'm in poor health,

26:37.865 --> 26:39.290
I'm smart enough.

26:41.815 --> 26:43.030
Listen to me.

26:43.590 --> 26:44.690
Just leave.

26:45.190 --> 26:46.315
Don't worry about me.

26:46.415 --> 26:48.150
I'll be better than anyone else.

26:49.190 --> 26:50.190
Then,

26:51.265 --> 26:52.965
I'll wait for you to take me home.

27:05.040 --> 27:09.691
(Baoguo Temple)

27:09.715 --> 27:10.955
Grandpa Wei, you've got tricks.

27:11.115 --> 27:12.550
I just followed orders.

27:12.615 --> 27:13.750
Please forgive me.

27:16.465 --> 27:20.590
(Baoguo Temple)

27:32.140 --> 27:36.690
(Baoguo Temple)

27:49.840 --> 27:50.941
Lady Zhihu.

27:50.965 --> 27:51.965
They've gone.

27:52.265 --> 27:53.545
Let's go inside and have a rest.

27:55.715 --> 27:56.715
Lady Zhihu!

27:57.490 --> 27:58.590
Lady Zhihu!

27:59.790 --> 28:01.550
Be quiet.

28:03.165 --> 28:04.890
Don't make him worry.

28:07.765 --> 28:09.715
I'm afraid I can't live till we go home.

28:19.950 --> 28:21.541
Uncle, since you've made a scene,

28:21.565 --> 28:23.990
there must be a lot of people
inquiring about the news today.

28:24.165 --> 28:25.750
After tonight,

28:25.815 --> 28:27.550
I'll sneak back to join them.

28:27.690 --> 28:29.310
Have you ever thought that

28:29.740 --> 28:30.926
if you were kept around Xu Fengnian

28:30.950 --> 28:32.390
deliberately by Xu Xiao,

28:32.790 --> 28:35.230
could your feelings to each other

28:35.665 --> 28:36.665
be real?

28:37.990 --> 28:39.630
The heart won't tell lies.

28:39.910 --> 28:40.767
Just let me

28:40.791 --> 28:42.790
accompany him to Mount Longhu.

28:43.790 --> 28:44.790
Your Grace,

28:45.315 --> 28:47.470
if Xu Fengnian is in danger,

28:47.765 --> 28:48.865
should I save him or not?

28:49.690 --> 28:50.870
Why not?

28:51.715 --> 28:53.190
If I save him,

28:53.640 --> 28:55.390
it's like telling the world

28:55.990 --> 28:58.365
that Xu Family and West Chu
are not enemies.

28:58.915 --> 28:59.950
At that time,

29:00.840 --> 29:03.540
there will be no turning back
for Xu Fengnian.

29:06.815 --> 29:08.446
Mr. Cao, you're highly skilled
in martial arts.

29:08.470 --> 29:09.470
You play chess well.

29:09.630 --> 29:10.670
You're very learned.

29:11.550 --> 29:13.190
But you know little

29:13.590 --> 29:14.526
about women.

29:14.550 --> 29:15.550
Why do you say that?

29:16.465 --> 29:18.470
It's better if Xu Fengnian
has no way back.

29:18.790 --> 29:20.566
Her Grace can take him

29:20.590 --> 29:21.790
to West Chu, then.

29:24.365 --> 29:25.485
- Uncle Chess Master.
- Yeah?

29:25.540 --> 29:26.630
I want to eat cats.

29:27.665 --> 29:29.340
Why are you so cruel?

29:30.065 --> 29:31.310
Will you talk nonsense again?

29:31.590 --> 29:33.190
I was telling the truth.

29:33.365 --> 29:34.790
Watch your tongue from now on,

29:35.040 --> 29:37.230
or your cat may have bad luck.

29:37.840 --> 29:39.430
Can I talk secretly?

29:39.565 --> 29:40.990
You should pray I don't hear it.

29:42.890 --> 29:44.326
Hey, wait for me.

29:44.350 --> 29:45.350
Hey!

30:02.690 --> 30:03.870
I'll go up and have a look.

30:08.665 --> 30:10.441
All right, I know.

30:10.465 --> 30:12.230
I won't let anyone assassinate him.

30:13.315 --> 30:15.710
What have I done that I deserve this?

30:21.265 --> 30:22.550
Without Jiang Ni,

30:23.350 --> 30:24.590
His Highness becomes quieter.

30:34.415 --> 30:35.830
Jiang Ni is a maid.

30:35.915 --> 30:37.126
You're a maid, too.

30:37.150 --> 30:38.865
Haven't you thought of replacing her?

30:39.640 --> 30:41.940
His Highness is the next lord
of North Liang,

30:42.190 --> 30:43.710
a powerful man in the world.

30:59.740 --> 31:00.886
To escape the notice of the government,

31:00.910 --> 31:02.690
Jiang Ni won't come back tonight.

31:04.740 --> 31:05.740
I know.

31:07.065 --> 31:08.515
Are you really going to let her go?

31:10.565 --> 31:12.070
I can't defeat Cao Changqing.

31:12.310 --> 31:13.267
If you want her to stay,

31:13.291 --> 31:14.715
I'll take care of Elegant Cao.

31:16.165 --> 31:17.691
That girl is with extraordinary
natural endowments.

31:17.715 --> 31:19.555
She is suited
for taking over the mantle of me.

31:19.940 --> 31:22.006
Then you should go to West Shu
to take the apprentice.

31:22.030 --> 31:23.190
Don't you want her to stay?

31:26.140 --> 31:27.150
I do.

31:29.365 --> 31:31.215
But Jiang Ni is not just my maid.

31:31.940 --> 31:33.390
She has her own way to go.

31:35.190 --> 31:36.446
I can't keep everyone around

31:36.470 --> 31:38.230
and not let them go.

31:38.590 --> 31:39.870
It's not fair to them.

31:41.590 --> 31:42.750
Fool.

31:43.090 --> 31:44.090
Huh?

31:44.890 --> 31:46.215
What a fool!

31:47.140 --> 31:47.915
Is it me?

31:48.040 --> 31:49.275
Do you think it's me?

31:51.440 --> 31:53.110
I can't defeat you, anyway.

31:53.150 --> 31:54.710
Say whatever you want.

31:55.715 --> 31:57.750
I saw you using Snakes in Sleeves.

31:58.165 --> 31:58.846
Was it okay?

31:58.870 --> 31:59.870
It was a complete mess.

32:00.915 --> 32:02.715
It seems that
I don't have natural endowments.

32:03.165 --> 32:04.566
Why is it Snakes in Sleeves

32:04.590 --> 32:05.790
instead of Dragons in Sleeves?

32:06.215 --> 32:07.590
Is there any hidden meaning?

32:08.215 --> 32:09.516
Flying snake turns into a dragon.

32:09.540 --> 32:11.030
Though dragon is noble and dignified,

32:11.365 --> 32:12.750
once a snake turns into a dragon,

32:12.815 --> 32:14.166
it becomes a beast

32:14.190 --> 32:15.806
that serves immortals and gods.

32:15.830 --> 32:16.890
It becomes their mount.

32:17.265 --> 32:19.105
Only the snake
that hasn't turned into a dragon

32:19.350 --> 32:21.646
harbors the ambition
of breaking through all obstacles

32:21.670 --> 32:22.990
and the arrogance

32:23.040 --> 32:24.366
of climbing up and conquering the world

32:24.390 --> 32:26.230
even if it must fight against itself!

32:26.490 --> 32:28.066
Only by remembering
the true meaning of the move

32:28.090 --> 32:30.430
can you master it.

32:30.615 --> 32:31.965
If you give in,

32:32.140 --> 32:33.750
you'll lose the unruliness.

32:34.315 --> 32:35.366
Give in to whom?

32:35.390 --> 32:36.910
To your true heart.

32:37.415 --> 32:38.486
People will be afraid.

32:38.510 --> 32:39.446
They will despair,

32:39.470 --> 32:40.287
fear

32:40.311 --> 32:41.390
or shrink back.

32:41.815 --> 32:43.806
All of those torture you from inside

32:43.830 --> 32:45.150
and stop you from moving forward.

32:45.315 --> 32:46.766
The real Snakes in Sleeves

32:46.790 --> 32:48.070
cuts off the knot in your heart.

32:48.315 --> 32:50.030
Only by getting rid of your fear

32:50.110 --> 32:51.341
can you break through all shackles

32:51.365 --> 32:52.860
and go your own way.

32:53.865 --> 32:56.116
Neither the swordplay nor the move
or the meaning is important.

32:56.140 --> 32:57.165
Understanding this

32:57.265 --> 32:59.225
helps you to master the move
of Snakes in Sleeves.

33:14.290 --> 33:17.270
(To the Son of Lord of North Liang)
If I want to control a man,

33:17.315 --> 33:18.515
the most important thing

33:19.340 --> 33:20.890
is to disturb his mind.

33:21.015 --> 33:22.270
Wu Su

33:23.265 --> 33:25.846
(Biography of Wu Su)
was Xu Fengnian's beloved mother.

33:25.870 --> 33:26.687
Through the images,

33:26.711 --> 33:28.310
we can affect his moods.

33:28.765 --> 33:30.216
The dragon

33:30.240 --> 33:32.070
will cut off his inner reliance on her.

33:32.365 --> 33:33.365
In other words,

33:33.440 --> 33:34.590
I'll let Wu Su

33:34.710 --> 33:36.465
die once again in front of him.

33:36.630 --> 33:37.390
And maybe,

33:37.640 --> 33:39.550
he'll become a lunatic.

33:40.815 --> 33:42.606
A lunatic

33:42.630 --> 33:45.070
becomes the next lord of North Liang.

33:45.315 --> 33:46.670
Isn't it the best result

33:47.030 --> 33:48.510
for the royal family?

33:59.565 --> 34:01.885
I'm going to ask His Highness
to come down and have a rest.

34:02.240 --> 34:02.950
General.

34:03.115 --> 34:04.206
We found a box near the camp.

34:04.230 --> 34:05.390
There is a note on it

34:05.440 --> 34:06.960
saying it's dedicated to His Highness.

34:09.265 --> 34:10.246
It's light.

34:10.270 --> 34:11.340
It doesn't look dangerous.

34:18.690 --> 34:21.140
(Biography of Wu Su)

34:24.890 --> 34:25.890
What's wrong?

34:26.040 --> 34:27.070
It's about the night

34:27.140 --> 34:28.741
when Her Grace
was ambushed in the capital.

34:28.765 --> 34:29.607
I think we haven't found

34:29.631 --> 34:31.465
any clues over the years, right?

34:32.040 --> 34:34.206
We must ask His Highness
to see it first.

34:34.230 --> 34:36.430
Guard the camp
and don't let anyone come up close.

34:36.690 --> 34:37.690
Yes.

34:41.215 --> 34:42.166
Keep on the alert.

34:42.190 --> 34:43.190
Yes!

34:44.165 --> 34:45.270
Don't worry.

34:45.665 --> 34:47.206
There is no poison on that book.

34:47.230 --> 34:49.041
Without tricks or poison,

34:49.065 --> 34:50.065
how can a book

34:50.165 --> 34:51.340
hurt people?

35:30.690 --> 35:31.930
Some of your words I understand

35:32.615 --> 35:33.646
while some I don't.

35:33.670 --> 35:34.710
What don't you understand?

35:34.865 --> 35:36.390
I don't understand

35:37.550 --> 35:39.110
how you cut off the knot in your heart.

35:39.965 --> 35:42.266
After all, the move of Snakes in Sleeves
is just sword energy.

35:42.290 --> 35:44.010
How could it
cut off the knot in your heart?

35:44.415 --> 35:46.515
You can't really stab yourself
in the heart, can you?

35:47.815 --> 35:48.815
Back in the day,

35:49.190 --> 35:51.665
I was bothered by the same question
for a long time.

35:51.890 --> 35:53.606
After I invented Snakes in Sleeves,

35:53.630 --> 35:55.640
I was almost unrivaled in the world.

35:55.790 --> 35:56.790
Since then,

35:56.815 --> 35:58.440
I've got the name of God of Sword.

35:58.815 --> 35:59.540
Extraordinary.

35:59.690 --> 36:00.670
But deep down inside,

36:00.710 --> 36:02.430
I was anxious and confused.

36:02.790 --> 36:03.846
I was struggling

36:03.870 --> 36:05.240
to find a way out.

36:05.415 --> 36:06.415
Why?

36:06.990 --> 36:08.326
Because my move

36:08.350 --> 36:09.830
needed unyielding wild snakes.

36:10.240 --> 36:11.806
But humans have the nature
of being slack

36:11.830 --> 36:12.742
and compromising.

36:12.766 --> 36:13.891
One day,

36:13.915 --> 36:15.910
if I lost the unyielding spirit,

36:16.315 --> 36:17.315
my swordplay

36:17.540 --> 36:19.190
would come to a dead end.

36:19.840 --> 36:21.890
So I was afraid and lost.

36:22.065 --> 36:23.566
It was like the dead end
had already come to me.

36:23.590 --> 36:25.190
I couldn't escape from it.

36:26.290 --> 36:27.416
I knew the dead end

36:27.440 --> 36:29.490
came from the fear in my heart.

36:29.715 --> 36:31.566
Only by breaking the misty barrier
deep down inside me

36:31.590 --> 36:33.315
could I move forward.

36:34.090 --> 36:35.740
Just like you asked me,

36:36.515 --> 36:38.415
I asked myself every day

36:38.690 --> 36:40.265
how I cut off the knot in my heart.

36:41.515 --> 36:42.540
You did it, didn't you?

36:42.865 --> 36:43.865
Yes.

36:44.640 --> 36:46.726
By improving the sword intent
of Snakes in Sleeves

36:46.750 --> 36:47.865
to another level,

36:48.215 --> 36:50.015
I invented my real unique move.

36:50.465 --> 36:51.646
It's called

36:51.670 --> 36:53.440
Open the Heaven's Gate.

38:11.890 --> 38:13.566
I seemed to see something.

38:13.590 --> 38:15.606
That's because I was influencing you
with the true meaning

38:15.630 --> 38:16.466
of Open the Heaven's Gate.

38:16.490 --> 38:17.407
What you saw

38:17.431 --> 38:18.765
was the secret of the move.

38:21.690 --> 38:22.950
You can show me a vision?

38:23.090 --> 38:24.441
When martial arts develop to perfection,

38:24.465 --> 38:25.791
they can influence you
from body to heart.

38:25.815 --> 38:27.990
They can achieve many things

38:28.015 --> 38:29.566
from changing reality
to affecting the spirit.

38:29.590 --> 38:30.350
So

38:30.390 --> 38:31.686
Some masters make you fear
and shrink back

38:31.710 --> 38:33.066
only by standing there.

38:33.090 --> 38:34.846
It's because you're overwhelmed

38:34.870 --> 38:35.870
by their spirit.

38:35.965 --> 38:37.190
Let's put it aside.

38:37.615 --> 38:39.465
What have you seen just now?

38:40.690 --> 38:42.565
I saw you splitting the sky.

38:43.240 --> 38:44.670
I don't understand.

38:47.215 --> 38:48.290
What is heaven's mandate?

38:48.390 --> 38:49.440
Heaven's mandate

38:49.540 --> 38:51.220
is natural justice
bestowed by natural law.

38:52.490 --> 38:53.990
What is the way of heaven and man?

38:54.315 --> 38:55.566
A man should respect heaven's mandate.

38:55.590 --> 38:56.447
If a man doesn't respect the heaven,

38:56.471 --> 38:57.646
the deepest disaster
will befall the man,

38:57.670 --> 38:58.526
which is invisible.

38:58.550 --> 38:59.442
That's why

38:59.466 --> 39:01.666
the ancients said man must
conform to the way of heaven.

39:01.790 --> 39:02.816
Those who go along with it
have good luck

39:02.840 --> 39:04.241
and those who resist it have ill luck.

39:04.265 --> 39:05.726
The way of heaven
covers all living creatures.

39:05.750 --> 39:07.206
Man lives under heaven,

39:07.230 --> 39:08.665
but eagers to be immortal.

39:08.915 --> 39:09.915
Through Heaven's Gate,

39:09.940 --> 39:11.766
man becomes immortal.

39:11.790 --> 39:12.806
Those who pass through the gate

39:12.830 --> 39:14.440
will lord it over all living creatures.

39:14.590 --> 39:16.060
But I refuse to accept it.

39:17.540 --> 39:18.470
Accept what?

39:18.510 --> 39:20.441
I refuse to accept
that heaven decides man's life,

39:20.465 --> 39:22.240
man can't be the master
of their own fate,

39:22.640 --> 39:24.640
man can't conquer heaven,

39:24.740 --> 39:26.530
and immortals overrun all living beings.

39:26.940 --> 39:28.246
I'll use my sword

39:28.270 --> 39:29.430
to split Heaven's Gate.

39:29.915 --> 39:31.526
All my life,

39:31.550 --> 39:32.686
I'll be a man who is dedicated

39:32.710 --> 39:34.566
to exploring the way of heaven
but not surrendering to it.

39:34.590 --> 39:36.326
I'll find my own way
without fearing immortals.

39:36.350 --> 39:38.741
Even if all gods and demons
come to earth,

39:38.765 --> 39:40.750
I'll kill them with my sword!

39:44.015 --> 39:44.847
Now, do you understand

39:44.871 --> 39:46.490
what Open the Heaven's Gate is?

39:49.915 --> 39:51.265
Defying fate

39:51.515 --> 39:52.675
and cutting off the shackles,

39:53.465 --> 39:54.716
with unyielding spirit,

39:54.740 --> 39:56.590
I'll get rid of all hesitation

39:56.940 --> 39:58.990
and the fear in my heart,

40:00.065 --> 40:01.590
thus, with a clear heart,

40:02.040 --> 40:03.265
I'll cross the mortal world.

40:03.840 --> 40:04.767
The idea

40:04.791 --> 40:07.290
is the soul of Open the Heaven's Gate.

40:09.065 --> 40:10.916
Did you master the move at that time?

40:10.940 --> 40:12.065
I did.

40:12.940 --> 40:14.590
How did you lose to Wang Xianzhi, then?

40:14.965 --> 40:16.486
During my fight against Wang Xianzhi,

40:16.510 --> 40:17.886
I only used Snakes in Sleeves.

40:17.910 --> 40:19.091
I didn't use Open the Heaven's Gate.

40:19.115 --> 40:20.115
Why?

40:20.215 --> 40:21.841
Wang is a talent.

40:21.865 --> 40:23.590
I didn't want him to die.

40:24.565 --> 40:26.140
So you'd rather lose to him?

40:28.340 --> 40:29.726
I wasn't sure if I could win

40:29.750 --> 40:30.750
without killing him.

40:31.315 --> 40:32.490
I hesitated a little.

40:32.715 --> 40:34.686
The moment I hesitated
while fighting Wang Xianzhi,

40:34.710 --> 40:35.750
I lost.

40:36.265 --> 40:37.765
You should have another fight.

40:38.590 --> 40:40.065
I thought so, too.

40:40.340 --> 40:41.501
I wanted to improve my skills.

40:41.525 --> 40:43.390
When I got full control of the move,

40:43.430 --> 40:44.766
I would have another fight
against Wang Xianzhi.

40:44.790 --> 40:46.246
I might probably win him

40:46.270 --> 40:47.192
without killing him.

40:47.216 --> 40:48.286
But the fight

40:48.310 --> 40:49.765
has never come true.

40:50.840 --> 40:52.590
Because soon after that,

40:53.040 --> 40:54.515
I lost my life.

40:55.065 --> 40:56.790
My sword intent and battle intent

40:57.790 --> 40:58.790
were all gone.

41:00.015 --> 41:01.665
How did you lose your life?

41:01.915 --> 41:03.565
You had mastered Open the Heaven's Gate.

41:03.940 --> 41:05.326
People don't get everything

41:05.350 --> 41:06.616
or live a happy life

41:06.640 --> 41:08.400
just because they're masters
of martial arts.

41:09.840 --> 41:10.687
I killed

41:10.711 --> 41:11.951
the most important person to me

41:12.715 --> 41:14.150
with my own hands.

41:17.715 --> 41:18.815
From that day on,

41:19.715 --> 41:20.990
nothing matters anymore.

41:21.265 --> 41:22.265
You...

41:28.490 --> 41:29.715
No matter what happened,

41:30.290 --> 41:31.290
it was all over.

41:36.515 --> 41:37.515
Your Highness.

41:37.765 --> 41:38.765
Mr. Li.

41:39.440 --> 41:40.110
Your Highness.

41:40.315 --> 41:42.391
We found a wooden box near the camp.

41:42.415 --> 41:43.766
Inside is the information

41:43.790 --> 41:44.567
about Her Grace's murder.

41:44.591 --> 41:45.690
Let me see.

41:48.440 --> 41:50.090
No matter what you see,

41:50.490 --> 41:52.890
don't forget the sword
that cuts off the knot in your heart.

41:53.015 --> 41:54.015
Yeah.

42:03.990 --> 42:06.110
(Biography of Wu Su)
The sword that cuts off the knot?

42:06.390 --> 42:07.565
Open the Heaven's Gate.

42:07.665 --> 42:08.990
Isn't it

42:09.265 --> 42:11.315
Mr. Li's legendary ultimate sword move?

42:12.915 --> 42:13.842
Did he pass it on to you?

42:13.866 --> 42:14.926
It's not a sword move.

42:14.950 --> 42:15.950
It's the true meaning.

42:16.615 --> 42:17.615
Huh?

42:21.165 --> 42:22.165
True meaning?

42:23.890 --> 42:26.030
Wang Xianzhi was also
in the capital that night.

42:26.815 --> 42:28.390
Is he the murderer of my mother?

42:29.015 --> 42:30.090
The origin of the box

42:30.540 --> 42:31.590
is unknown.

42:31.715 --> 42:32.940
It isn't necessarily true.

42:33.140 --> 42:34.830
Do you know what the painting is?

42:36.240 --> 42:38.641
(Biography of Wu Su)

42:38.665 --> 42:39.965
It looks like

42:40.830 --> 42:42.540
some doodles.

42:43.690 --> 42:45.450
It doesn't affect reading.

42:45.740 --> 42:46.890
Leave it alone.

42:54.990 --> 42:59.998
(Biography of Wu Su)

43:29.870 --> 43:32.590
♪ The flower of pain ♪

43:34.365 --> 43:37.165
♪ Blooms in my heart ♪

43:39.090 --> 43:42.010
♪ I made a bet with the dawn ♪

43:43.090 --> 43:46.890
♪ That you'll answer ♪

43:48.190 --> 43:51.090
♪ Forgive this tragic end ♪

43:52.790 --> 43:55.610
♪ Moved by the moment we met ♪

43:57.615 --> 44:00.370
♪ In spite of thunder and lightning ♪

44:01.390 --> 44:05.315
♪ In spite of my falling ♪

44:05.815 --> 44:08.546
♪ When we are apart ♪

44:08.570 --> 44:09.810
♪ I'll collapse ♪

44:10.590 --> 44:14.450
♪ Capture an image of the memory ♪

44:15.265 --> 44:17.991
♪ After all these ups and downs ♪

44:18.015 --> 44:19.450
♪ The vanity ♪

44:19.940 --> 44:23.815
♪ Who will open it again ♪

44:24.240 --> 44:25.591
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:25.615 --> 44:28.450
♪ It's enough ♪

44:28.865 --> 44:31.346
♪ Drowned in sadness ♪

44:31.370 --> 44:33.770
♪ Just to see through ♪

44:34.065 --> 44:36.091
♪ I will whisper love to you ♪

44:36.115 --> 44:38.291
♪ For a lifetime ♪

44:38.315 --> 44:42.530
♪ End the worry in the world ♪

44:42.890 --> 44:44.026
♪ It's worth it ♪

44:44.050 --> 44:47.090
♪ I'll be there for you all my life ♪

44:47.265 --> 44:49.226
♪ After the moments of beauty ♪

44:49.250 --> 44:51.970
♪ You are my reason to be ♪

44:52.530 --> 44:54.346
♪ If there is a way ♪

44:54.370 --> 44:56.866
♪ To start over ♪

44:56.890 --> 45:00.990
♪ Will you still remember me ♪
